#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match application protocols or services detected by nDPI."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon a de protocòls o de servicis d'aplicacion "
"detectats per nDPI."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid "Create rules that match destination IP addresses or networks directly."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon dirèctament a d'adreças IP o de rets de "
"destinacion."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match destination domain names. Domain-based bypass "
"requires OpenMPTCProuter DNS to be used by clients."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon a de noms de domeni de destinacion. Lo "
"contorn per domeni exigís que los clients utilizen lo DNS d'OpenMPTCProuter."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match destination ports, for example to steer selected "
"services."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon a de pòrts de destinacion, per exemple per "
"dirigir de servicis causits."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match destinations announced by a specific autonomous "
"system number."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon a de destinacions anonciadas per un numèro "
"de sistèma autonòm especific."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match source ports generated by local applications or "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon a de pòrts sorga generats per d'aplicacions "
"o de periferics locals."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match traffic from a local source IP address or subnet."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon al trafic d'una adreça IP sorga locala o "
"d'un sosret."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/services/omr-bypass.js
msgid ""
"Create rules that match traffic from specific client devices by MAC address."
msgstr ""
"Crear de règlas que correspondon al trafic de periferics client especifics "
"per adreça MAC."

